/// `atomic_with_ghost!` supports the types
/// [`AtomicU64`] [`AtomicU32`], [`AtomicU16`], [`AtomicU8`],
/// [`AtomicI64`], [`AtomicI32`], [`AtomicI16`], [`AtomicI8`], and [`AtomicBool`].
